    {
      "id": "dd307f5e-e289-46da-b15c-94c2796018d2",
      "name": "Batch and model routing1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1376,
        -1520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 684,
        "height": 1092,
        "content": "## AI step\n\n**Basic LLM Chain** processes items in parallel. Tune batching for provider rate limits. **Model Selector** routes `small` to GPT 6 Luna and `big` to Gemini 3.8 Flash. **Structured Output Parser** applies `jsonSchema`; auto-fix may add calls. Use the blue note to connect replacement models and credentials."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f364b958-726d-4b9c-b424-06354535f38c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
